      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "✓ WebSocket replaces Lambda Function URLs\n   (Persistent connection vs cold start hell)\n\n✓ Subprocess persists across requests\n   (No re-init on every call)\n\n✓ 5-step security pipeline\n   (SonarQube + Bandit + GitGuardian)\n\n✓ One-command client config\n   (Auto-write MCP settings)",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "✓ WebSocket replaces Lambda Function URLs\n   (Persistent connection vs cold start hell)\n\n✓ Subprocess persists across requests\n   (No re-init on every call)\n\n✓ 5-step security pipeline\n   (SonarQube + Bandit + GitGuardian)\n\n✓ One-command client config\n   (Auto-write MCP settings)",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 153
